"""Door-M FMA logo step (Oct 28 2026, Rafael approved). Run LAST, after v7.py and subpages.py.
Idempotent: swaps any old logo block (Maison) for the door-M wordmark, points favicons/og at the new files,
and adds the small header/footer CSS. Logo files come from RAFAEL14741/fma-ad public/brand/door-m/."""
